{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25708","headline":"贡院楼北新栽小松 · 吴武陵","name":"贡院楼北新栽小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂槛爱贞容，移根自远峰。\n已曾经草没，终不任苔封。\n叶少初陵雪，鳞生欲化龙。\n乘春濯雨露，得地近垣墉。\n逐吹香微动，含烟色渐浓。\n时回日月照，爲谢小山松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}